      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Activities",
      "Anchor": "activities",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The Activities API resolves an Activity URN into the underlying DomainEntity, such as a Share, UGC Post, Comment, Article, Group Post, or Instant Repost.\nThis API returns no personal data and is scoped strictly to DMA-approved activity types.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Overview",
      "Anchor": "overview",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Overview"
      ],
      "Text": "An Activity represents an action performed by a LinkedIn member on content.\nEach activity is uniquely identified by:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Overview",
      "Anchor": "overview",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Overview"
      ],
      "Text": "urn:li:activity:{id}",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Overview",
      "Anchor": "overview",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Overview"
      ],
      "Text": "The Activities API performs a Batch_Get to resolve one or more Activity URNs into their corresponding underlying entity URNs.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Supported Activity Types",
      "Anchor": "supported-activity-types",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Overview",
        "Supported Activity Types"
      ],
      "Text": "The Activities API can resolve Activity URNs that correspond to the following types of LinkedIn content:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Supported Activity Types",
      "Anchor": "supported-activity-types",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Overview",
        "Supported Activity Types"
      ],
      "Text": "Like - Reactions to posts or content\nShare - Reshared content\nComment - Comments on posts\nGroupPost - Posts within LinkedIn groups\nUgcPost - User-generated content posts\nLinkedinArticle - Published LinkedIn articles\nInstantRepost - Quick reposts of content",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Supported Activity Types",
      "Anchor": "supported-activity-types",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Overview",
        "Supported Activity Types"
      ],
      "Text": "For activities that correspond to unsupported content types (such as Reactions), the API will return an HTTP 403 error with the message Activity\u0027s verb type is not allowed from the ActivityFilter.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
